{
  "about": "The match intake contract as DATA (src/community-logic/match/match-intake-evidence.mjs reads it): the five factors a match is scored on, the primitives a question serves, the intake questions a member's AI answers (each with the claim kinds its answer yields), and which claim kinds each factor must cite on each side. A community picks its questions from these by id (matching.evidence.questions).",
